AirPlay (RAOP) protocol (internal/protocols/airplay)
  Implemented from public protocol documentation and the behaviour of
  shairport (James Laird) and shairport-sync (Mike Brady). No code from
  those projects is included. The RSA key in keys.go is the AirPort
  Express key that has been public since 2011 and is used by every
  third-party AirPlay receiver; it is not a secret.
